# Chorus
First you put your two knees close up tight, then you
D5/. D5// B4/. B4// G4 A4 D5/ B4 G4/ ~G4 A4/. Ab4//
sway 'em to the left, then you sway 'em to the right,
G4/. G4// A4/. A4// Bb4 A4/. G4// Bb4/. Bb4// A4/. A4// G4 r
