F4/. F4// G4/. G4// A4 G4/. F4// C5/ A4 F4/ ~F4 D5/. C#5//
twis' a-round and twis' a-round with all your might.
D5/. C#5// D5/. Bb4// C5/. B4// C5/. A4// Bb4/ ~A4/ G4/ A4/ ~A4 r
Stretch your lov-in' arms straight out in space, then you
D5/. D5// B4/. B4// G4 A4 D5/ B4 G4/ ~G4 A4/. Ab4//
